---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Lincoln Egress Windows"
  description="What Lincoln Egress Windows collects when you browse this site or call the number on it, who else receives it, and how to ask us to delete it."
  canonical="https://lincolnegresswindows.com/privacy/"
>
<Fragment slot="head">
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://lincolnegresswindows.com/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Privacy Policy", "item": "https://lincolnegresswindows.com/privacy/"}]}</script>
<style is:global>
  .legal { max-width: 780px; }
  .legal h2 { font-family: 'Nunito Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 1.45rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0A3D5C; margin: 2.2rem 0 0.7rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .legal p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #4A5A66; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .legal ul { padding-left: 1.4rem; margin: 0 0 1.1rem; }
  .legal li { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: #4A5A66; margin-bottom: 0.45rem; }
  .legal strong { color: #2B3A44; font-weight: 700; }
  .legal a { color: #1273A8; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .legal a:hover { color: #0C5680; }
</style>
</Fragment>

<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="max-width:1220px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px 24px;">
  <ol style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;gap:8px;font-size:13px;color:#8A9AA5;">
    <li><a href="/" style="color:#1273A8;text-decoration:none;">Home</a></li>
    <li>/</li>
    <li style="color:#5A6B76;">Privacy Policy</li>
  </ol>
</nav>

<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0A3D5C 0%,#1273A8 100%);padding:60px 24px 68px;">
  <div style="max-width:1220px;margin:0 auto;">
    <h1 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,42px);font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 14px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:620px;margin:0;">What we collect when you browse this site or call the number on it, who else receives it, and how to ask us to delete it.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding:56px 24px 76px;">
  <div style="max-width:1220px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div class="legal">

      <p>This policy explains what Lincoln Egress Windows collects when you use this website or call the number on it, why we collect it, and who else receives it.</p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>Lincoln Egress Windows operates lincolnegresswindows.com as a referral service for egress window work in Lincoln and southeast Nebraska. We are not a contractor. See our <a href="/disclosure/">disclosure</a> for how that works.</p>

      <h2>Information you give us</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Through the contact form:</strong> your name, phone number, email address, property location, and whatever you write about the project. The form is handled by Formspree, which passes it to us.</li>
        <li><strong>When you call:</strong> your phone number, the time and length of the call, and the number you dialled.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Calls are tracked, and may be recorded</h2>
      <p>The phone numbers on this site are tracking numbers. When you call, the connection is handled by a call-routing provider that records call metadata — the originating number, the time, the duration, and which page or campaign the number appeared on — so the referral can be attributed and paid for.</p>
      <p><strong>Calls may also be recorded by the provider or by the contractor who answers.</strong> Where a call is recorded you will normally hear a notice at the start. If you would rather not be recorded, say so when the call connects, or use the contact form instead.</p>
      <p>Call records are shared with the contractor receiving your enquiry and with the advertising network that connects the call, because both need them to handle your job and to account for the referral.</p>

      <h2>Information collected automatically</h2>
      <p>Like most websites, we receive technical information from your browser: IP address, browser and device type, referring page, and which pages you viewed. We use <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> for aggregate traffic measurement, with IP anonymisation enabled. Google's practices are covered by the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      <p>Google Analytics sets cookies. Most browsers let you block or delete cookies in their settings, and the site works without them.</p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To connect you with an egress window contractor serving your area.</li>
        <li>To respond to what you asked us.</li>
        <li>To understand which pages are useful and which are not.</li>
        <li>To account for referrals with the contractor or network that pays for them.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not send marketing email or texts from this site.</p>

      <h2>Who receives your information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>The contractor</strong> who takes your enquiry. Once your details reach them, their privacy practices apply, not ours.</li>
        <li><strong>Our call-routing and advertising network partners</strong>, for connection and attribution.</li>
        <li><strong>Formspree</strong>, which processes contact form submissions.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong>, as described above.</li>
        <li><strong>Anyone we are legally required to disclose to</strong>, such as in response to lawful process.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>Enquiry and call records are retained for as long as needed to handle the enquiry and to account for the referral, then deleted. Analytics data is retained on the schedule set in Google Analytics.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Ask us what we hold about you, or ask us to delete it.</li>
        <li>Ask not to be recorded when a call connects.</li>
        <li>Block cookies in your browser, or use its Do Not Track setting.</li>
        <li>Use the contact form rather than the phone if you prefer not to be called back.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To make any of these requests, email <a href="mailto:info@lincolnegresswindows.com">info@lincolnegresswindows.com</a> or <a href="/#contact">get in touch</a>. Note that once your details have been passed to a contractor, you will need to contact them directly about what they hold.</p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>This site is intended for adults arranging work on property. We do not knowingly collect information from children under 13.</p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>The site is served over HTTPS and we take reasonable measures to protect what we hold. No method of transmission over the internet is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes materially we will update the date below. Continued use of the site after a change means you accept the revised policy.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy, or about information we hold: <a href="mailto:info@lincolnegresswindows.com">info@lincolnegresswindows.com</a>.</p>

      <p style="margin-top:2.5rem;font-size:14px;color:#8A9AA5;">Last updated: 20 August 2026</p>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
